B.aWm=s(["1. Information We Collect\nWe collect your name, email, contact number, date of birth, gender, and payment details (including the proof-of-payment image you upload) solely to process your membership and improve our services.","2. How We Use Your Information\nYour data is used for membership management, billing, service notifications, and facility access. We do not share your data with third parties except as required by law.","3. Data Privacy Act Compliance (RA 10173)\nPrimeFit Fitness Gym processes your personal information in accordance with Republic Act No. 10173, or the Data Privacy Act of 2012, its Implementing Rules and Regulations, and the issuances of the National Privacy Commission (NPC). Your data is collected for a specified and legitimate purpose, kept only as long as necessary, and processed fairly and lawfully.","4. Data Security\nWe implement reasonable organizational, physical, and technical security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.","5. Your Rights as a Data Subject\nUnder RA 10173, you have the right to be informed, to access, to object, to rectify errors, to request erasure or blocking, to data portability, to claim damages, and to file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (www.privacy.gov.ph). To exercise these rights, contact our front desk or support email.","6. Cookies & Tracking\nOur digital services may use cookies to enhance user experience. You may disable cookies in your browser settings.","7. Contact Us\nFor privacy concerns or to reach our data protection contact, email primefitnesstaguig@gmail.com or visit our front desk in Taguig City."],t.s)
